{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over Engineered is simulation strategy game that encourages construction of complex machines. Using limited space, money, and power; you must build complex contraptions to bring a ball from its spawn, to its goal. The longer each ball takes, the more money you make in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.poster.avif?t=1764621068\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.webm?t=1764621068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/2a0f885c43b394d0aaff1f1b79f10dd9.mp4?t=1764621068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Parts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new machine parts to build more complex contraptions. Give each item a whirl and see what new creations you can bring into your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Balls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new balls with various properties that can shift the style of your gameplay. Each gives a new multiplier to help continue your need for complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Skills:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras/76d34bcbd891ac998bdec27bf53906fd.avif?t=1764621068\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706500/extras_big/76d34bcbd891ac998bdec27bf53906fd.webp?t=1764621068 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game goes on, leveling up will become harder an